            "paragraph": "Calculating air temperature change. The set of air temperature data monitored at borehole sites is incomplete. To develop data comparable to the permafrost temperature data, we calculated mean annual air temperatures (T) from ERA Interim 2 m air temperature data set with 80 km spatial resolution.",
